WEBVTT

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.256
in the roof of your mouth,

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:02.816
you've got to get them all.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:05.576
So Ed would do this

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:08.096
and he would --

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:10.816
his face would light up and he would say,

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:14.816
"This coffee tastes of Honeycrisp apple

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:18.376
and notes of soil and maple syrup."

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:21.016
And I would take a sip and I'd say,

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:23.776
"I'm picking up coffee.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.616
(Laughter)

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:27.496
It tastes to me like coffee."

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:29.536
(Laughter)

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:32.496
But inspired by Ed, I decided to really